<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia posts $764.6 mln trade surplus in Nov.</title>
<headline>Indonesia posts $764.6 mln trade surplus in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's trade surplus stood at $764.6 million last November compared to $995.7 million in October, a government official said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The official gave no further details. Indonesia posted a trade surplus of $633.8 million in November 1995.</p>
<p>The government will announce the final figures after the monthly cabinet meeting on the economy at around 0600 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
